        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. Subject to Section E.4. below, vacation allowances are as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                126,
                598,
                747,
                635
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    126.0,
                    598.0
                ],
                [
                    747.0,
                    598.0
                ],
                [
                    747.0,
                    635.0
                ],
                [
                    126.0,
                    635.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. An active full-time employee with less than five (5) years of continuous employment shall be granted two (2) weeks vacation (eighty (80) hours) each year with pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                166,
                643,
                749,
                720
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    165.9483184814453,
                    643.0349731445312
                ],
                [
                    747.3425903320312,
                    638.0055541992188
                ],
                [
                    748.0,
                    713.9999389648438
                ],
                [
                    166.60572814941406,
                    719.0293579101562
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. An active full-time employee who has completed five (5) full and complete years of continuous employment, but less than sixteen (16) years, shall be granted three (3) weeks vacation (one hundred twenty (120) hours) each year with pay.",
            "block_bbox": [
                166,
                735,
                748,
                829
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    166.0,
                    735.0
                ],
                [
                    748.0,
                    735.0
                ],
                [
                    748.0,
                    829.0
                ],
                [
                    166.0,
                    829.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. An active full-time employee who has completed sixteen (16) full and complete years of continuous employment shall be granted three (3) weeks and one (1) day vacation (one hundred twenty-eight (128) hours) that year with pay. After completing each additional full and continuous year of employment one additional day of vacation will be granted until after completing nineteen (19) full and complete years of continuous employment three (3) weeks and four (4) days (one hundred fifty-two (152) hours) vacation with pay will be granted.",
            "block_bbox": [
